    "title": "Barometer Plus - Altimeter",
    "description": "Barometer Plus app measures air pressure and altitude using your device's built-in barometric pressure sensor.\r\nBecause air pressure changes usually indicate a weather change, you can use this app to monitor and predict short-term weather variations.\r\nPeople suffering from migraine, headaches, or joint pain can monitor how barometric pressure impacts their mood.\r\nFishermen can monitor the atmospheric pressure for right-time fishing.\r\nYou can use the app for virtually all outdoor and indoor activities, such as climbing, trekking, hiking, and even stair climbing.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u2022 The app contains a barometer and altimeter with a personalization graphic in classic analog style. It also displays the current temperature and humidity.\r\n\u2022 Display barometric pressure (sensor value) or mean sea level pressure (MSLP - value used in weather forecast services or stations).\r\n\u2022 Units support for pressure: mb, inHg, kPa, atm, Torr, psi, hPa, mmHg. Units for altitude: meter, feet.\r\n\u2022 Calibrate the barometer using altitude/location from the GPS. Calibrate the altimeter using the nearest airport information/METAR, or manually enter the QNH of the nearest airport. Offset sensor output value.\r\n\u2022 Measure the height (building/mountain/hiked/climbed) using the \"Relative Altitude\" feature (can be enabled in the app's Settings).\r\n\u2022 Notification about pressure change. \"Notification custom rule\" for you to define how and when the app sends notifications.\r\nNotify when air pressure changes indicate that extreme or worse weather may occur.\r\n\u2022 \"Pressure Tracking\" and \"History Graph\" for atmospheric barometer monitor.\r\n\u2022 \"My Area\" allows you to define your frequent stay places, and the app tracks air pressure with location data.\r\n\u2022 Export history to CSV format.\r\n\u2022 This app is the digital version compared with an aneroid or mercury barometer and can be adjusted to MSLP with additional features.\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZABLE:\r\nYou can change your barometer/altimeter appearance with:\r\n\u2022 Seven different housing colors.\r\n\u2022 Black, white or blue disk background.\r\n\u2022 Four different app backgrounds.\r\n\u2022 Three different types of needles.\r\n\u2022 Marker needle for easily monitor.\r\n\u2022 Dark or light widgets theme.\r\n\r\nNOTES:\r\n\u2022 App only works on devices with a barometer sensor.\r\n\u2022 Short-term weather forecast (12-24 hours) with icon on the disk was based on local pressure sensor data, which may not be 100% accurate.\r\n\u2022 Each time your device reboots, open the app for tracking with the \"Exact update interval\" feature work.\r\n\u2022 You may take the phone/tablet far away from computers, cables, and other magnetic sources to get accurate results.\r\n\r\nIf you like this app, please support us - you can remove ads or unlock paid features from the menu: Shop.\r\nWe welcome your ideas and suggestions - please email us at: support+barometer@pvdapps.com.\r\nFollow our official Facebook page: https://www.facebook.com/barometerplus/ or Twitter account: https://twitter.com/pvdapps.",
